  "title": "Permute — basic exact",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Permute — basic exact",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Relier les contrôles aux ports nommés, puis lancer Run. Les types et valeurs sont explicites; sélectionner la fiche n'exécute rien.\nEntrées : n (u32) = 5; k (u32) = 2.\nRésultats attendus : result (f64) = 20.\n\nCounts ordered selections of k distinct elements among n, without replacement.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: windows-x64; LLVM 22.1.7; exact declared scalar signature.\nExpected:\noutput-result (f64) = 20\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["numeric-math", "typed-values", "independent-oracle", "example"],
    "documentation_uri": ""
  },
